{"body_markdown":"","change_reason":"按已审稿的独立技术单元和双文档结构保存可读研究内容","content_hash":"976805005ce60c7e09bce64cef90ba39502f583551ab196f9664438175bb0c90","created_at":"2026-09-09T06:32:34.154111Z","created_by":{"id":"codex-approved-v3-report-author","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"workspace_summary","keywords":["浮点求和","顺序敏感","补偿","有限构造输入"],"kind":"document_section","level":null,"owner_id":"RES-FLOATING-POINT-SUMMATION","payload":{"blocks":[{"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":3,"sha256":"c9ab320069397e5219eca068d85e33fd7636368db676026a7f9d3f1f68863c20","target_id":"MEM-c52df8fb-ca9e-53a7-a49b-342592884a50","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":3,"sha256":"f622c9730e82aa63f77c098592809f4aef8b601cfe747931c42974de741ad9cd","target_id":"MEM-c4a61c00-1bf1-59b3-a65e-0fa4847db2e1","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":3,"sha256":"4e863128333d48e4bb228682a3664fbabd1155143bc92db2d6a1d1b50db6cf86","target_id":"MEM-96f79923-f023-509e-a002-40f2d5a4fca1","target_kind":"record"}],"markdown":"本研究回答了三个有界问题：逐项累加会因顺序不同而丢失单位增量；本次Kahan实现存在可逐步解释的三项抵消反例；该类反例在保存的30项、多排列输入中仍会出现。Neumaier与math.fsum在所测第二、第三组中均与精确参考值一致，构成值得进一步检验的候选，而非任意输入正确性的证明。\n\n下一步应把尚未覆盖的问题分开验证：\n\n1. **非整数输入**：区分十进制目标值的表示误差与已表示浮点数的求和误差。\n2. **极端指数**：明确溢出、下溢及可表示范围，选择适用的参考算法。\n3. **跨平台复算**：读取同一份固定数组，核对环境和结果，不依赖seed产生相同排列的假设。\n4. **性能比较**：在正确性检查之外单独设定规模、计时条件与重复次数。\n\n这些扩展尚未执行。当前结论限于本文的构造输入与已记录环境，尚未经过人工研究复核。","type":"prose"}],"missing_refs":[],"role":"conclusion","section_key":"process-conclusion","title":"结论与下一步","watch_refs":[{"baseline_record_hash":"c9ab320069397e5219eca068d85e33fd7636368db676026a7f9d3f1f68863c20","baseline_revision":3,"record_id":"MEM-c52df8fb-ca9e-53a7-a49b-342592884a50","watch_type":"revision"},{"baseline_record_hash":"f622c9730e82aa63f77c098592809f4aef8b601cfe747931c42974de741ad9cd","baseline_revision":3,"record_id":"MEM-c4a61c00-1bf1-59b3-a65e-0fa4847db2e1","watch_type":"revision"},{"baseli